# Gallery section scope

When working on the **gallery** block, change only gallery-related files. Do not edit hero, nav, video, social, services, contact, or unrelated styles/scripts.

## Allowed files

| Purpose | Path |
|---------|------|
| Markup | `components/gallery.html` |
| Styles | `styles/gallery.css` |
| Images | `assets/images/gallery/**` |
| Grid, upload, image load | `scripts/modules/gallery.js` |

## Optional (with user approval)

- `scripts/config.js` — `fgsAuto` (url, logo, tag), `gallery` array, `galleryServices` array; remove `component-services` from `components` when merging services here
- `styles/responsive.css` — only `.fgs-auto-*` and `.gallery-*` rules inside the `@media (max-width: 900px)` block

## Content

- Section brand: **FG'S AUTO** · 富贵车房 — local auto shop block.
- Gallery items from `FGS_CONFIG.gallery`; services from `FGS_CONFIG.galleryServices`.
- All gallery cells, service cards, and the CTA link to `fgsAuto.url` (default `https://fullgreatbros.com/FGAUTO`) in a new tab.
- Image paths: `assets/images/gallery/` via `file`, or full `src` for one-off assets.

## Assets

- Put new gallery images under **`assets/images/gallery/`**.
- Reference filenames in config only (e.g. `shop-floor.jpg`), not full paths in markup.

## Do not

- Edit `scripts/app.js`, `index.html`, or other component HTML unless the user explicitly approves.
- Change section tag/title copy in `gallery.html` unless the user asks.

If a change requires another file, ask the user before editing outside this scope.
